    "prompt": "Use case: photorealistic-natural. Asset type: premium contemporary botanical editorial photographic asset, portrait 3:4, image only.\nA single deep-purple iris bloom on one slender stem, accompanied by one long green iris leaf, photographed as a carefully art-directed botanical portrait. Real macro photography: exquisite natural petal texture, veins and delicate partly translucent folds, deep plum and violet petals with small honest golden details at the flower center, finely observed organic edges. Minimal warm cream to very pale blush-pink studio backdrop, subtle natural tonal depth and quiet negative space. The single flower has a precise recognizable silhouette and rests in an asymmetrical composition with the stem and the one long leaf providing a long elegant line. Premium contemporary independent art-journal photography, sensitive controlled sidelight, beautiful but believable real botanical detail, sharp flower with gently softer stem depth. Leave breathing room for an editable cover crop. Do not create three flowers, a bouquet, a full-field floral pattern, stickers, watercolor, gouache, pastel painting, faux paper texture, heavy grain, excessive props or dramatic fake shadows. No text, no labels, no letters, no logos, no frame, no watermark. Portrait 3:4.",
    "production_description": null,
    "prompt_record_type": "verbatim prompt retained from V4 record",
