    "prompt": "Use case: product-mockup. Asset type: premium independent coffee-brand editorial photographic asset, landscape 4:3, image only.\nA deliberate top-down photographic still life: dark brown-black brewed coffee in one small round off-white porcelain cup, on an architectural geometric tabletop composed of deep olive-green and graphite-gray planes. A very sparse arrangement of a few warm yellow-orange coffee cherries or roasted beans adds a tiny warm color counterpoint. Angled late-afternoon sun creates one or two precise confident shadows and reveals the crisp geometric surface boundaries. Bold useful negative space across part of the image, art-directed placement rather than a centered stock-photo grouping. Sophisticated contemporary editorial product photography, real ceramic rim, glossy dark coffee surface, restrained subtle tabletop finish, high-end material detail without fake roughness. Palette: warm off-white cup, near-black coffee, dark olive and graphite with tiny yellow-orange accents. Do not include green mugs, kraft coffee bags, potted plants, hands, people, bags, piles of beans, marble luxury clichés, many random shadows or rustic cafe props. No text, no letters, no logos, no labels, no watermark. Landscape 4:3, top-down view.",
